WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Check the actual frame width: 390px.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.400
Choose the project’s matching 390px
breakpoint.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:13.891
Use Default only if this breakpoint has no
default.

00:00:15.291 --> 00:00:20.291
Choose Named variant and a unique name for
an alternate design.

00:00:21.691 --> 00:00:25.782
A mismatched width needs resizing and a
new review.

00:00:27.182 --> 00:00:30.682
Confirm name, appearance and breakpoint
together.
